1147 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Product Designer  \057  EverCommerce\nApr 2023 \055 Present\054 Toronto\054 ON\nLeading end\055to\055end design and validation of merchant\055 and customer\055facing payments features for Invoice Simple\054 empowering 500K\053 business in their day\055to\055day operations\nExpanded multichannel capabilities by driving conception and execution of tap to pay and mobile check capture workflows\054 delivering 13\045 lift in total payment volume\nRedefined user activation journey and improved subscription paywall messaging through funnel analysis and A\057B testing\054 growing free\055to\055paid conversion by 58\045\nPiloted novel free trial experience to augment feature discoverability and adoption\054 increasing document creations by 27\045 and driving 10\045 skew towards higher\055tier subscription packages\nAudited and refined layout\054 type hierarchy and colour of mobile app interface\054 partnering with engineers to build 10\053 WCAG 2\0562 AA\055level\055compliant components)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1148 0 R
     /Pg 1137 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

