1149 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Product Design Intern  \057  Intuit\nMay \055 Aug 2022\054 Toronto\054 ON\nLed iterative design of the QuickBooks online payment portal\054 integrating PayPal and Venmo into a platform that powers \044300M\053 in transactions daily\nValidated competing solutions through contextual inquiries and usability testing with 10 participants\054 uncovering payor pain points within checkout flow\nFacilitated design thinking workshops involving 9 cross\055functional stakeholders to prioritize product requirements and accelerate roadmap alignment)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1150 0 R
     /Pg 1137 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
